## 10. Recommended Testing Direction (cheatsheet-keyed)

- **If a mobile app is in scope** → run MASTG static/dynamic testing per `secskills kb mobile`; the mobile backend is a web API — cross-apply the Web Top 10.
- **If LLM/agent features are in scope** → test direct and indirect prompt injection, unsafe output handling, and excessive tool agency per `secskills kb llm-agents`.
- **Deep follow-up (authorized):** `secskills test <target> --confirm --deep` adds nuclei; add TLS cipher enumeration, content discovery (ffuf), and manual validation of the highest-severity findings.

