## 15. Glossary

- **CVSS** — Common Vulnerability Scoring System (severity 0–10).
- **CWE** — Common Weakness Enumeration (root-cause weakness class).
- **OSV** — Open Source Vulnerabilities database (api.osv.dev), used for component CVE lookup.
- **HSTS** — HTTP Strict Transport Security header enforcing HTTPS.
- **IDOR** — Insecure Direct Object Reference (a broken-access-control pattern).
- **SSRF** — Server-Side Request Forgery.
- **MASTG/MASVS** — OWASP Mobile Application Security Testing Guide / Verification Standard.
- **Differential exposure check** — an endpoint is flagged only when it differs from a random-path baseline (defeats catch-all 200s).

