  <section class="page"><h2>Edge &amp; Defense Map (CDN / WAF / origin looking-glass)</h2><div class="rem"><p>_Edge could not be fingerprinted (primary host unreachable)._</p></div></section><section class="page"><h2>6. Compliance Coverage Matrix</h2>
