| Provenance of tested hosts | All tested hosts are subdomains of the authorized apex `never-assessed.example`, discovered via passive DNS / certificate-transparency (subfinder, crt.sh). |
| Authorization | Operator attestation: `--confirm` supplied. Written authorization is an engagement prerequisite and is **not** validated or stored by the assessment engine. |

> **Cross-domain note.** Any related external domains surfaced during OSINT (via shared certificates, ASN, or DNS) are **not** tested or included here. They are reported separately as *discovered attack-surface pivots* and require explicit ownership/scope confirmation before being considered part of this target's posture.

