| unauth-exposure | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| **Total** | **0** | **0** | **0** | **0** | **0** | **0** |

_Denominator semantics: **Eligible** = control applies to the endpoint (TLS-version applies only to HTTPS; HTTP-only endpoints are **N/A**). **Tested** = eligible endpoints reachable at test time (Tested = Passed + Failed). **Inconclusive** = eligible but unreachable/errored — never counted as Passed/secure. Eligible = Tested + Inconclusive._

